      "message": "test(pocket3d_hsm): pin the bore's path exactly per measured platform\n\nThe planner's output differs slightly between platforms (macOS Apple\nsilicon: 16160 / 15432 / 1571 against Windows x86_64's 16197 / 15458 /\n1581; issue #1010 owns bit-stability). The (moves, planar, arcs) triple\nis exact on each measured platform and a band on unmeasured ones; every\nplatform-independent assertion stays exact.\n\nRefs #980\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
